{"id":"658451","name":"泡椒笋炒牛肉","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/658451/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"350g"},{"name":"泡椒笋","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"3瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉泡出血水，抓匀码低味腌制10分钟。","img":"images/658451/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡椒笋捞出来。","img":"images/658451/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅热油。","img":"images/658451/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把牛肉炒变色，盛出来备用。","img":"images/658451/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"一丢丢的油，小火煸炒泡椒笋，炒出香味。","img":"images/658451/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入牛肉，大火翻炒几下。","img":"images/658451/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"脆嫩好吃。","img":"images/658451/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}